  "transport_limitations": [
    "One operator-configured Confluence Cloud site and approved numeric spaces only.",
    "Hosted actions and self-managed actions and polling are preview. Hosted triggers, Data Center, Desktop, headless manual credentials and webhooks are unsupported.",
    "Polls observe latest versions after a silent baseline. They can miss intermediate edits, deletions, short-lived pages and access gaps.",
    "Original createdAt separates newly created pages from old pages moved into a space. Newly visible existing pages are not update events until a later version is observed.",
    "Each source retains at most 5000 distinct observed IDs and completes at most 50 requests of 100 pages. Partial snapshots never advance cursors."
  ],
